                "text": "No one is cutting Medicaid\u2014Republicans are preserving it. In reality, the House bill simply improves upon Medicaid program integrity and slows the rate of the program\u2019s growth, which is currently unsustainable. Incentivizing work and community engagement while disallowing federal dollars to be spent on things like transgender surgeries is better for taxpayers and for families.",
