                "text": "Democrat lies and fearmongering have no place in Oklahoma - especially when it comes to our rural healthcare. It will be half a decade before most changes made in the One Big Beautiful Bill are felt in Oklahoma hospitals, proving ample time to adapt funding models.  While the closure of any hospital can be a devastating loss, unfortunately, discussions around the future of the Stilwell Memorial Hospital began well before President Trump even took office.\n\nhttps://t.co/v71VrAEptx",
