                "text": "A few key facts Democrats don\u2019t want you to notice in their $1.5 trillion bill:\n\u00a0\n\ud83d\udea8Make temporary COVID-era plus-up for the (un)Affordable Care Act permanent\n\ud83d\udea8Government healthcare benefits to people ILLEGALLY present in the US\n\ud83d\udea8Repeal $50 billion rural healthcare fund\n\ud83d\udea8Prioritize Electric Vehicle access in HOV lane\u2014regardless of how many people are in the car\n\u00a0\nEvery September for the past four years, Congress has voted on a clean CR, but this time Democrats want to punish the American people and @POTUS, while appealing to their radical-left base.",
